              "type": "MULTIPLE_CHOICE",
              "title": "<div data-editor-id=\"ff5461ee-7880-4eb3-8d31-b5768d4bf1d5\"><ol start=\"2\"><li><p><span style=\"font-size: 1.5rem\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); text-decoration: inherit\" data-color-scope=\"outer\"><strong><span>How can AI affect ownership of engagement processes?</span></strong></span></span></p></li></ol></div>",
              "answers": [
